\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Thou that art in difficulty
\par \pard\li225\sl180\slmult0 Obtain some relief in patience,
\par Thou that art in favoured life,
\par Lead a calm and humble life.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. For a life of patience favours
\par \pard\li225\sl180\slmult0 He that leads a life of distress,
\par And a humble life is good
\par For those in prosperity.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. He that is in both situation,
\par \pard\li225\sl180\slmult0 Immuned to the earthly changes,
\par And liveth a life of joy,
\par Lives in both good and evil.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   4. When he faces times of distress,
\par \pard\li270\sl180\slmult0 And gets to the brink of collapse,
\par He shall need to keep patience,
\par So that he can keep stable.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   5. When prosperity and progress,
\par \pard\li270\sl180\slmult0 Tend to elevate him so much,
\par He shall then humble himself,
\par And avert a future fall.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   6. Perhaps thou art not progressing,
\par \pard\li270\sl180\slmult0 And troubled by many problems,
\par Still maintain a patient stand,
\par Until changes are in place.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl180\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  7. When thou hast all things just in place,
\par \pard\li270\sl180\slmult0 And thou hast nothing to ask for,
\par Even then, be thou humble,
\par Thou know not the day of change.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li315\sl180\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8. Art thou troubled by strange persons?
\par \pard\li315\sl180\slmult0\qj Art thou not loved by thine neighbours?
\par Thou hast committed no crime,
\par Even then, keep this patience.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li315\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 9\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 9. Thou may be regarded highly,
\par \pard\li315\sl180\slmult0 Highly praised and given reverence,
\par Keep a good check on your thoughts,
\par  That you don't get arrogant.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li315\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 10\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 10.  When under stress, do keep patient
\par \pard\li315\sl180\slmult0 In prosperous times, be humble.
\par For, patience declares habit,
\par humility drives out fear.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 11\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 11.  All two I shall therefore maintain,
\par \pard\li315\sl180\slmult0 And stick to them throughout my life,
\par I enjoy peace through patience,
\par And have joy in being humble
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

